### G.2 Geometric Median (Weiszfeld)

```python
def geometric_median(points, eps=1e-6):
    y = np.mean(points, axis=0)
    for _ in range(50):
        dists = np.linalg.norm(points - y, axis=1)
        dists = np.where(dists < 1e-10, 1e-10, dists)
        new_y = np.sum(points / dists[:,None], axis=0) / np.sum(1/dists)
        if np.linalg.norm(new_y - y) < eps:
            return new_y
        y = new_y
    return y
```

